	(text "R701 sets permanent loading (-6..-7.5 % of k) and coupling\n(H_inj ~ -24 dB). Default 3.32k; 4.99k/10k trade coupling\nfor loading. D702 + D701 = two-stage ESD path (D701 required).\nKeep R706/R702/R701 in the same Yageo RT thin-film series."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.954 202.184 0)
