	(text "CAL_IN port J701: relative self-test and cross-unit\ncalibration injection into the detector node (RFIN).\n+20 dBm CW max (termination-limited); never exceed.\nRemove the W1 jumper and the shield before any RECORD.\nNever plug the AIMD coax into CAL. R703||R704 = 50 ohm load."
