	(text "Input limit at J702 (model; confirm in X10): <= 22 Vpk CW at 127.74 MHz, <= 24 Vpk CW at 63.86 MHz,\nno 40 Vpk CW soak. ADL5511 RFIN 5.6 Vpp abs max binds at about 28.5-29.3 Vpk (de-embedded S1P),\nso larger R706/R702 alone do not raise it; keep pulses below 28 Vpk until X10 measures it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92.71 156.21 0)
