		(property "Function" "Connects the AIMD coax to the series RF input network; the input is not a 50-ohm termination. Bond the shield to the ground plane at entry and keep the center-pin path to R706 short. Input limit at J702 (P1-18, model-derived; confirm in X10): <= 22 Vpk CW at 127.74 MHz, <= 24 Vpk CW at 63.86 MHz; a 40 Vpk CW soak is not supported. Short pulses: about 34 Vpk by the R706/R702 power model only; the ADL5511 RFIN 5.6 Vpp abs max is reached at about 28.5-29.3 Vpk with the de-embedded S1P, so larger R706/R702 alone do not raise the limit and pulses stay below 28 Vpk until X10 measures it."
			(at 90.17 127 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
