		(property "Function" "Feed-through filter into the RF/AFE area: +5V_A enters here and leaves as +5V_RF (U702 VPOS, C701, C704, C702-C706, C709, U701). S21 about -59 to -68 dB at 64/128 MHz. Rev A has no shield can; place it on the east wall of the AFE GND ring (P1-17 / D16, checkpoint 4) with both GND pads straight into ring copper, at least 2 GND vias per GND pad."
