		(property "Function" "Half of the far-end 50.0-ohm port termination (with R704). Keeps k independent of jumper state (spread 0.11 % or less, versus up to about 0.5 % without it) and makes the port a matched line (return loss 24-36 dB). 0603 for power: 50 mW each at +20 dBm, 100 mW rating. Own GND via."
