		(property "Function" "Injection resistor from the CAL port into RFIN.\n- Sets a constant 6.0-7.5 % loading and -23.9..-24.3 dB coupling.\n- Its RFIN-side land sits on an In1 void, which saves 0.9 % of loading at 128 MHz.\n- Same Yageo RT thin-film series as the re-sourced R706/R702 (RT0402BRD071K5L), so R(f) tracks in TCR. Mixed vendors could have moved R(f) by about 0.05 % per 10 K."
			(at 189.23 88.9 0)
			(hide yes)
