		(property "Function" "First ESD stage on the 50-ohm port node at the J701 pad (rule R35: pad, then TVS, then GND via within 0.5 mm; via 0.44 mm away).\n- Capacitance 0.15 pF typ / 0.19 pF max.\n- 5 V standoff: it never conducts at +20 dBm (3.16 Vpk).\n- Two-stage with D701: D702's turn-on overshoot couples through R701's 0.02-0.05 pF into RFIN (1.9-4.5 V per 100 V), so D701 conducts during port ESD.\n- Ref is D702 because D1001 exists on External_ADC.kicad_sch.\n- Reuses D701's verified DSN0603-2 land."
			(at 175.26 109.22 0)
			(hide yes)
